{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42580","headline":"登祝融峰 · 王元","name":"登祝融峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草叠到孤顶，身齐高鸟翔。\n势疑撞翼轸，翠欲滴潇湘。\n云湿幽崖滑，风梳古木香。\n晴空聊纵目，杳杳极穷荒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}